1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,340
When you walk into a great barbershop you can feel it before anyone says a word,

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,555
because there is coffee in the air,

3
00:00:06,755 --> 00:00:08,720
quiet music in the background,

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,427
and someone who looks at you,

5
00:00:10,627 --> 00:00:14,317
and asks how your week was before they ever talk about your hair.

